 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "By faith old Noah built an ark before the rain came down",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By faith went Abraham from home across the unknown ground",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By faith the people crossed the sea as if on solid land",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By faith the walls of Jericho fell down at God's command",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The conviction of what we do not see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Small as a mustard seed in my hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But it rests on the One who carries me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The apostles said to the Lord, Give us more faith",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he spoke of the smallest seed a farmer ever sows",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you have faith like a mustard seed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will say to this mountain, Move from here to there",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And it will move",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing will be impossible for you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
